, \"TL response\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"multi-audit-filename-convention-approval\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"decision\", \"record_kind\": \"advice_review\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"history\", \"enactment\": {\"status\": \"NOT_ENACTED\", \"missing\": [\"NOT_A_POLICY_CHANGE\", \"NO_ENACTMENT_EVIDENCE\"]}}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-29T16:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-29T16:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"multilingual_eval\", \"batch_id\": \"multi_batch_11\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"same_batch\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U001\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"tl_approved\", \"decision_status\": \"tl_approved\", \"execution_status\": \"not_executed\", \"outcome_status\": \"not_observed\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[PRIOR RECORD (advice_review; decision_status: tl_approved; execution_status: not_executed; outcome_status: not_observed) - history, not a standing rule.]\\n# Approve English field names for the audit index\\n\\n## Evidence available at review\\n\\nThe September 28 audit packet used mixed headings for the same metadata field: task_id, ID de tarea, and タスクID. The review coordinator manually matched three equivalent columns. The packet also included original Spanish and Japanese text excerpts; no defect in those excerpts was alleged.\\n\\nThe proposed index convention uses English metadata keys task_id, locale, and reviewer_id, with attachment names multi11_<locale>_<task_id>.txt. Only the administrative labels and filenames would change. No index revision has been published yet.\\n\\n## Prior ThreadSense advice\\n\\nUse En